<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: required -->
  <VME_Library_Required.label>必要</VME_Library_Required.label>
  <!-- EN: A place of learning is essential for our community. A nice collection of marvelous tomes and filled shelves will fill our hearts with joy.\n\n<color=#E5E54C>Gameplay effect:</color>\n - Colonists gets mood penalties / bonuses depending on size of library rooms found in the map. Only library rooms with an impressiveness of "decent" or higher will count for this calculation. Libraries will need to be clean or colonists will complain too! -->
  <VME_Library_Required.description>一间用于学习知识的图书馆对殖民地的发展来说至关重要。各种非凡的著作集和塞得满满的书架能让我们感到心情愉悦。\n\n&lt;color=#E5E54C>游戏效果：&lt;/color>\n - 殖民者会依据地图上的图书馆大小来获得心情减益/增益。只有房间观感达到“体面”或更高的图书馆才会被计算在内。此外，如果图书馆变得脏乱不堪，殖民者们也会感到不满！</VME_Library_Required.description>
  <!-- EN: Need library -->
  <VME_Library_Required.comps.0.thoughtStageDescriptions.0>需要图书馆</VME_Library_Required.comps.0.thoughtStageDescriptions.0>
  <!-- EN: Unimpressive library (less than decent impressiveness) -->
  <VME_Library_Required.comps.0.thoughtStageDescriptions.1>平庸的图书馆（房间观感未达到“体面”以上）</VME_Library_Required.comps.0.thoughtStageDescriptions.1>
  <!-- EN: Dirty library -->
  <VME_Library_Required.comps.0.thoughtStageDescriptions.2>脏乱的图书馆</VME_Library_Required.comps.0.thoughtStageDescriptions.2>
  <!-- EN: Small library (less than 50 tiles) -->
  <VME_Library_Required.comps.0.thoughtStageDescriptions.3>狭小的图书馆（少于50格）</VME_Library_Required.comps.0.thoughtStageDescriptions.3>
  <!-- EN: Spacious library (less than 100 tiles) -->
  <VME_Library_Required.comps.0.thoughtStageDescriptions.4>宽敞的图书馆（少于100格）</VME_Library_Required.comps.0.thoughtStageDescriptions.4>
  <!-- EN: Huge library (more than 100 tiles) -->
  <VME_Library_Required.comps.0.thoughtStageDescriptions.5>很大的图书馆（超过100格）</VME_Library_Required.comps.0.thoughtStageDescriptions.5>
  
